flowchart TD
  Request[Chat or agent request] --> Router[AI orchestrator]
  Router --> Registry[Model registry and task routing]
  Registry --> Provider[Provider manager]
  Provider --> Ollama[Ollama local provider]
  Provider --> Remote[Configured remote provider]
  Ollama --> Result[Normalized response]
  Remote --> Result
  Result --> UI[API response or stream]
  Provider -. unavailable or failed .-> Fallback[Configured fallback policy]
  Fallback -.-> Remote
